A developer writes this trigger.

    trigger ContactTrigger on Contact (before insert) {
        for (Contact c : Trigger.new) {
            Account a = [SELECT Id, Name FROM Account WHERE Id = :c.AccountId];
            c.Description = a.Name;
        }
    }

200 contacts are loaded in one data load. What happens?

What does this trigger do?

    trigger InstallationTrigger on Installation__c (before insert) {
        for (Installation__c i : Trigger.new) {
            if (i.Planned_Date__c == null) { i.Planned_Date__c = Date.today().addDays(14); }
        }
    }

This after update trigger runs.

    for (Account a : Trigger.new) {
        a.Description = 'Reviewed';
    }

What is the result?
